{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Maria, great to chat again! I joined a service-focused online group last week and it's been an emotional ride. Everyone there is incredible with their own inspiring stories. They've opened my eyes to new perspectives, and I'm feeling a sense of connection and purpose with them."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_3-fd40dee0433ddd8ec34a29da", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:07.382082+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fd40dee0433ddd8ec34a29da", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fd40dee0433ddd8ec34a29da", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John! That's amazing news. It's great to see you finding such a supportive community that is making a difference."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_3-797eaf682c016c359eb3aa62", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:07.411413+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "797eaf682c016c359eb3aa62", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "797eaf682c016c359eb3aa62", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! It's great to have a group of people with the same passion for serving. It's been really inspiring sharing stories, advice, and encouragement."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_3-73f0904d0378ecced2eacace", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:07.440278+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "73f0904d0378ecced2eacace", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "73f0904d0378ecced2eacace", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: That's great to hear! It's always inspiring to share thos things with like-minded individuals. By the way, have you had the chance to meet any of them in person?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_3-fbe749f44cc271ae12119153", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:07.461288+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fbe749f44cc271ae12119153", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fbe749f44cc271ae12119153", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: We held some events and got to meet some people. We went to a homeless shelter to give out food and supplies. Seeing the smiles on their faces, we knew we made a real difference. We also organized a toy drive for kids in need. It was amazing seeing the community come together to spread some joy."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_3-ce86cea830a9a5b11b153599", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:07.480964+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ce86cea830a9a5b11b153599", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ce86cea830a9a5b11b153599", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: That sounds great, John. It's nice to see the difference you're making. Do you have any ideas for future projects?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_3-f2e6ac92148a7542b0decd81", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:07.505621+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f2e6ac92148a7542b0decd81", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f2e6ac92148a7542b0decd81", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: We're brainstorming some to help underserved communities get access to education, mentorship, job training, and resume building. The goal is to empower individuals in achieving their aspirations."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_3-f24ef095578d2ae62918f06d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:07.524891+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f24ef095578d2ae62918f06d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f24ef095578d2ae62918f06d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: That's great, John! Empowering individuals through education and mentorship is crucial for helping them reach their goals. Can't wait to see the initiatives you come up with!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_3-fbd4735a8735e8fba350b532", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:07.547896+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fbd4735a8735e8fba350b532", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fbd4735a8735e8fba350b532", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! I'm really excited about them too. I believe that providing the right assistance and resources can make a lasting impact."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_3-8d6b0d118b47fdfcb64fe726", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:07.574080+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8d6b0d118b47fdfcb64fe726", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8d6b0d118b47fdfcb64fe726", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yep John, a bit of support can make an amazing change. You're spot on about it, it really is powerful. Keep doing what you're doing, it's really inspiring!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_3-357caf69d9f4d3b39b441131", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:07.599261+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "357caf69d9f4d3b39b441131", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "357caf69d9f4d3b39b441131", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! I really appreciate your support, It means a lot to me. Especially after I failed the military aptitude test recently, I've been feeling a bit stressed out."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_3-9b4b4fb45b9e2ff395591f73", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:07.618707+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9b4b4fb45b9e2ff395591f73", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9b4b4fb45b9e2ff395591f73", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: No worries, John. I'm here for you and I got your back. Nature's beauty reminds me to slow down and enjoy the small stuff."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_3-b22127f3cb2d37bf23e9c368", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:07.639310+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b22127f3cb2d37bf23e9c368", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b22127f3cb2d37bf23e9c368", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: That's a chill pic! Where did you find it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_3-dc3459bcad3dd193d0480b91", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:07.657967+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dc3459bcad3dd193d0480b91", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dc3459bcad3dd193d0480b91", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: I took it at the beach last month. Watching the sunset was so peaceful, it made me feel connected to nature and appreciate life's small moments."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_3-029f7e3b05d0b630bfc65602", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:07.674371+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "029f7e3b05d0b630bfc65602", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "029f7e3b05d0b630bfc65602", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, nature can be so beautiful! It reminds me of the film camera I had as a kid, I took plenty of beach pics. Thanks for sharing."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_3-f62e743cfe37204100f11bb1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:07.696057+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f62e743cfe37204100f11bb1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f62e743cfe37204100f11bb1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Glad you enjoyed it, John! It's amazing how beautiful it can be."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_3-761a36bf04746abe70b77d16", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:07.715823+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "761a36bf04746abe70b77d16", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "761a36bf04746abe70b77d16", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, it does. It helps us remember the small joys, especially when life gets busy."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_3-4bbf00549d568bc12dc0bdaa", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:07.737227+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4bbf00549d568bc12dc0bdaa", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4bbf00549d568bc12dc0bdaa", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
